{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/jw3lkk","slideIndex":3,"text":"This diagram describes the prompt-directed workflow, not a deterministic Java state machine. A fresh username-scoped literal summary search supplies candidates. The model must compare their actual issue details. Failed searches must not count as no match. Active matches should be displayed. For a closed match, Liza asks whether to reopen the existing ticket or create a new one. Explicit reopening calls reopenTicket. A new ticket follows the normal summary and confirmation flow.\n\nSource: helpdesk.st; TicketToolsImpl.java; TicketRepository.java"}
