{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/5hudil","slideIndex":4,"text":"After explicit confirmation, createTicket validates summary length 1–4000, issue type, priority and username. It loads an existing creator and selects a SUPPORT user. Ranking is fewest OPEN tickets, then fewest INPROGRESS, then most total tickets, then lowest user ID. JPA supplies ID and timestamps. Two asynchronous mail tasks are joined before return, so the request waits for both. Mail is sent before the transaction finishes committing.\n\nSource: TicketToolsImpl.java; HelpdeskUserRepo.java; TicketServiceImpl.java; Ticket.java"}
