{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/50s6zl","slideIndex":7,"text":"Creation sends separate creator and assignee messages, but both recipient arguments currently use the same hard-coded demo address. The scheduler runs daily at 10:00 Asia/Kolkata, despite an hourly comment. It selects OPEN and INPROGRESS tickets, skips incomplete rows, and checks age since creation. HIGH: 24 hours, MEDIUM: 48, LOW: 72. Qualifying tickets receive mail on each later run because no last-reminded marker exists. Age uses server-local LocalDateTime.\n\nSource: TicketServiceImpl.java; TicketReminderScheduler.java; HelpdeskSendEmailServiceImpl.java"}
