{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/qg0wym","slideIndex":8,"text":"Preparation: Java 25 and Maven, MySQL schema ai_help_desk_app on localhost:3306, Ollama on localhost:11434 with the configured model, working SMTP environment settings and an existing creator plus SUPPORT user. Run .\\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run. Use Postman or curl.exe with a cookie jar and Content-Type: text/plain. Endpoint: http://localhost:8085/api/connect-helpdesk. Example issue: VPN disconnects repeatedly and prevents work. Supply a real seeded username. The assistant may ask clarifying questions. Confirm only after reviewing the proposed summary. Read back the actual returned ID rather than a fabricated example. For the closed-ticket branch, prepare a separate CLOSED ticket. Choose reopen, then compare updatedOn and createdOn in the database. Repeat with another CLOSED ticket and choose create new. Verify the old record remains closed. Do not use GET /api/test casually because it sends real emails.\n\nSource: application.properties; TicketController.java; helpdesk.st"}
