{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/qe3upo","slideIndex":11,"text":"Registered through .tools(ticketTools, generalTool). findTicketCreatedByUserName: Lists tickets created by the exact username. findTicketAssignedToUserName: Lists tickets assigned to the exact username. findTicketByStatus: Lists OPEN, INPROGRESS or CLOSED tickets. findTicketByTicketPriority: Lists tickets with LOW, MEDIUM or HIGH priority. findTicketByCreatedOn: Lists tickets created on a calendar date. createTicket, reopenTicket and updateTicket require explicit user confirmation in their tool instructions. updateTicket currently assigns optional fields unconditionally. Summary search is literal and case-insensitive, not semantic search. Time tools use the server timezone. findTicketAssignedTo ranks fewest OPEN, then fewest INPROGRESS, then most total tickets, then lowest user ID. Lookup tools marked returnDirect=true may return ticket data directly.\n\nSource: TicketTools.java; GeneralTool.java; TicketToolsImpl.java; GeneralToolImpl.java"}
