{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/zc2l0n","slideIndex":12,"text":"Registered through .tools(ticketTools, generalTool). findHelpdeskUserByUserName: Loads a helpdesk user by exact username. findTicketAssignedTo: Selects SUPPORT user by workload ranking. getCurrentDateTime: Returns the current server date and time. getTodayDate: Returns the current server calendar date. createTicket, reopenTicket and updateTicket require explicit user confirmation in their tool instructions. updateTicket currently assigns optional fields unconditionally. Summary search is literal and case-insensitive, not semantic search. Time tools use the server timezone. findTicketAssignedTo ranks fewest OPEN, then fewest INPROGRESS, then most total tickets, then lowest user ID. Lookup tools marked returnDirect=true may return ticket data directly.\n\nSource: TicketTools.java; GeneralTool.java; TicketToolsImpl.java; GeneralToolImpl.java"}
