{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/4yrao8","slideIndex":13,"text":"This presentation reflects static source analysis. The application was not started and no live model, database or SMTP integration was exercised for this deck. The focused suite passed 20 tests covering session forwarding, memory separation, lookup semantics, creation validation, reopen validation and the timestamp lifecycle callback. This does not establish live model compliance or database integration behavior. Rehearse with seeded users, controlled email recipients and isolated demo tickets. Prioritize null-safe patch semantics, authorization, deterministic confirmation checks and notification delivery after commit. Repeated reminders need a delivery history or cooldown if required by the product.\n\nSource: src/test/java/com/helpdesk; source files reviewed throughout this deck"}